WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:07.269
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and yesterday
I asked you all to submit questions for a

00:00:07.269 --> 00:00:11.299
new Game of Thrones related Q&amp;A. I meant to
do Q&amp;As every week but I got so many requests

00:00:11.299 --> 00:00:16.280
for Teen Wolf videos this summer monday nights
it turned my schedule into a nightmare.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.109
In the next two weeks I’m moving to a new
apartment and quitting my job to be a youtube

00:00:19.109 --> 00:00:23.480
weirdo full time so it’s going to be crazy
for a little while longer but then you’ll

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.980
start seeing more Q&amp;As and bonus videos for
everything.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:31.160
If you’re just finding me and have no idea
what the hell I’m talking about. I do weekly

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.010
game of thrones videos and a weekly song of
ice and fire book giveaway, be sure to subscribe

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:37.129
to get everything.

00:00:37.129 --> 00:00:40.780
George RR Martin just went to the Edinburgh
book festival and there was supposed to be

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:44.690
a livestream. I haven’t found a video link
but if he says anything interesting about

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:47.719
Winds of Winter I’ll include it in a bonus
video.

00:00:47.719 --> 00:00:52.640
Let’s answer some questions! Most of these
I picked are Sand Snake and Season 5 related.

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:58.129
Starting with Number 1 - Jon Targaryen asks
will you please do a Winds of Winter Predictions

00:00:58.129 --> 00:00:58.960
Video?

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:04.489
I always love trying to figure things out.
The reason I don’t do videos like this all

00:01:04.489 --> 00:01:11.489
the time is because as of the end of last
year George RR Martin’s total book sales

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:13.939
were only about 28 Million. That’s a lot
of Song of Ice and Fire fans.

00:01:13.939 --> 00:01:15.920
But most of the people who subscribe to me
only watch the show, or they just got started

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:18.579
with the books. During Season 4 the show averaged
10 Million viewers per an episode.

00:01:18.579 --> 00:01:23.860
So as a compromise I only do big prediction
videos every once and a while. Even for the

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:30.840
show.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:37.840
Martin withdrew from writing anything for
the show to focus on winds of winter. In my

00:01:38.049 --> 00:01:44.270
fantasy he finishes the book in time for the
Season 5 finale in June 2015. November 2015

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:48.880
at the latest. So I’ll start doing more
book specific videos when that gets closer.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:55.590
I don’t have an exact idea for when, but
I usually use twitter and facebook to poll

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:59.740
for interest in video topics so you can always
follow me there if you’re not already. Links

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:01.060
at the bottom of the description.

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:04.560
moving on Question number 2 - Alek Kanwischer
(no avatar) asks do you have a favorite character

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:06.759
you want to see on the Iron Throne?

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:10.070
I don’t think I’ve said this before, but
in the last year I’ve actually stopped thinking

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:13.120
of the Iron Throne as a desirable thing.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:20.120
Think about it this way. The crown is hopelessly
in debt, everyone at court is a liar or a

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:26.830
thief. And the really interesting people have
been scattered to the four winds.

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:33.560
I think the real goal should be to restore
the supernatural balance. There are maybe

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:36.980
a handful of characters in the books that
have their minds on that. The rest are all

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:41.750
focused on the here and now. Either gaining
control of a city or a single kingdom in the

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:42.940
case of Westeros.

00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:49.940
The Iron Throne is just a symbol, Robert Baratheon
won the throne and it ended up killing him.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:03:00.510
If you’re someone like Bronn then you really
don’t care about anything except having

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:05.280
sex with your new wife Lollys in your new
castle. I tend to think more like Maester

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:09.200
Aemon. He has a much broader perspective on
what’s happening in the world just because

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:10.350
he’s seen so much history.

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:14.160
I actually have a lot of spoilery thoughts
about maester aemon that I’ll write in the

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.700
comments for anyone that wants to read them.

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:22.030
On to Question 3 - Edvuxas112 asks do you
think they’ll show a big non-book scene

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:24.700
like the white walker in episode 4?

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:28.920
You’re asking if the show will do something
from the books that was happening but George

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:33.760
RR Martin didn’t write it in a POV chapter.
Definitely yes, they said they’re going

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:38.080
even further off book for a number of reasons.
Which means there’s an even better chance

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:41.180
they’ll include something they think is
really important regardless of whether or

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.810
not George RR Martin chose to include it.

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:48.730
I think a good example would be showing us
the creation of Robert Strong. In the books

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:53.010
it’s just implied who he is and where he
came from. Qyburns lab underneath the black

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:57.420
cells. Or they’ll show us more of Qyburn’s
black magic. Or what the other characters

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:58.380
think is black magic.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:02.180
He’s kind of like the doctor frankenstein
of the series, blending the knowledge of the

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:06.090
maesters with necromancy and other magic.
I’m also hoping to learn more about him

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:07.290
in Winds of Winter.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:11.230
Speaking of which, I also think more of these
non-book scenes from the Lands of Always winter

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:15.510
will happen, but not a lot. I don’t think
they’d go a whole year without showing a

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:17.190
big white walker scene.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:21.890
Question 4 - Josephine Swift asks what do
you think they’ll do with the Ironborn characters?

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:25.660
I think the show is going to narrow it’s
focus to characters it’s already spent most

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:30.030
of it’s time on, Theon for all intents and
purposes is the ironborn storyline even though

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:34.230
last season Yara said he wasn’t her brother
anymore just because he had been consumed

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:36.040
by the Reek persona.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.730
Ironborn are completely gone but I think they’ll
take all the big victarion and euron moments,

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:41.950
pick the most essential parts and give them
to her. It’s like when cut out Edric Storm

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:43.890
and gave his story to Gendry.

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:46.900
I think that’s what they’ll do with the
Uncles. I know everyone really wants to see

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:51.720
them but unless they cast them by October
or November, they won’t make it into season

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.790
5. And at that point it would be cheaper and
easier for them to just send Yara to the place

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:59.380
where Euron goes in Book 5. That’s really
when his story starts to get interesting.

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:03.320
They could truncate the kingsmoot and just
give all of that plot to her from then on

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:03.730
out.

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:10.090
I’ll still do a video for the Greyjoy Uncles
at some point. But when I do I’ll make sure

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:14.000
to say what I think the show will change specifically
about their plot.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.730
Question 5 - Nick Falba (no avatar) asks,
what do you think they’ll do with the Dornish

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:21.600
master plan given that a lot of the involved
characters haven’t been cast?

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:25.710
If anyone hasn’t heard about the Dornish
master plan, it’s a plan that Oberyn Martell

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:32.710
and Prince Doran concocted after Elia was
killed to get revenge on the Lannisters. I

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:36.370
think the best way I can explain it without
going into crazy spoilers is that I think

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:38.820
the show will just simplify everything.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:45.370
It seems like they cut out Arianne, who’s
role inside the master plan had already been

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:50.040
changed because of character deaths. And Quentyn,
the backup, was also not cast. So they’ll

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:52.550
probably just cut out the whole marriage part
of the plan with those two characters. And

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:57.850
promise Trystane to the person Quentyn was
trying to marry.

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:00.240
I said it in my Sand Snakes video but I’m
pretty sure based on the recast that they’ll

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:01.440
spend more time on the Myrcella plot. It’s
technically not part of the Master Plan, Myrcella

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:02.260
was part of Arianne’s side plot. I think
the show will just add Myrcella to their version

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:02.360
of the Master Plan.

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:05.540
Sorry if that sounds confusing. Right now
Trystane is betrothed to Myrcella, that won’t

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:09.970
change. But they’ll probably tease the Quentyn
plot behind the Lannister’s backs. I don’t

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:13.550
think they’ll send Trystane on the trip
Quentyn took though. I think they’ll just

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:16.270
tease it in a letter they send.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:23.190
I’ll clarify even more in the comments for
people that need it.

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:26.980
But moving on Question 6 - Flying Spectacles
says, once they’re done with the show, they

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:31.260
should do other big historical events like
Robert’s rebellion, the andal invasion etcetera.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:38.139
Yes, all good suggestions, you listed a bunch
of the big historical events. Game of Thrones

00:06:38.139 --> 00:06:43.590
is a huge deal at HBO, this year it became
their most watched series of all time. Meaning

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:47.800
it’s making them more money than anything
next to their sporting events. Or driving

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:51.940
subscriptions. They don’t advertise, so
profits are measured in premium subscribers.

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:56.490
This is the same deal at AMC with Walking
Dead, that show is so profitable that AMC

00:06:56.490 --> 00:07:00.050
is going to bend time and space to keep Walking
Dead content on their network till the end

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.620
of time. Just because it’s guaranteed profits.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:06.770
They already signed a development deal with
George RR Martin during season 1 for a spin

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:11.960
off show. There haven’t been any announcements
about it since then, but as long as Martin

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:17.730
gives HBO the rights to future content, they’ll
keep doing it. Either as tv series or miniseries

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:18.790
or tv movies.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:24.540
Do not worry, there will be some form of Game
of Thrones content for at least the next 4

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:28.740
years, after that I can’t say. Just because
HBO hasn’t made any official comments about

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:30.180
stuff after the main series.

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:34.710
Question 7 - Albert A asks, do you think they’re
going to take out Jaime’s Story in Book

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:36.990
4 or do it later?

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:42.090
If you watched the spoilery part of my video
yesterday I said that he and Bronn will go

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:45.510
somewhere different. So they’ll probably
just cut out the Riverrun stuff completely.

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:51.180
The King’s Landing stuff that he’s involved
in will probably stay the same.

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:57.680
Question 8 - Capn Jack asks was the picture
of Bradley James a coincidence or did my spoiler

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.330
casting dreams just come true?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:03.880
That was just me using a picture for a person
I thought resembled Harry Hardyng. He’s

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:07.100
not on the show and they haven’t cast that
character. There’s a billion characters

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:10.889
in a song of ice and fire, but there’s not
pictures for a lot of them. So when you talk

00:08:10.889 --> 00:08:15.169
about someone that there’s no media for
you have to get creative.

00:08:15.169 --> 00:08:19.360
If I were a halfway decent artist I’d make
my own fan drawing for people when I talk

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:20.540
about them.

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:24.510
I suppose there’s always a chance Brad James
could make it on the show. But usually game

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:28.210
of thrones casts lesser known actors. Jonathan
Pryce is the exception this season because

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:31.860
he’s a really big actor. It gives you an
idea for how much weight they’re going to

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:38.240
place on the High Sparrow character.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:43.500
Question 9 - bh061709 asks with the death
of JJ Murphy what do you think they’ll do

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:44.890
at the wall?

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:49.339
For anyone that didn’t hear an actor playing
a night’s watch character just died in real

00:08:49.339 --> 00:08:49.990
life.

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:55.880
JJ Murphy was playing Denys Mallister. He
was going to be the biggest candidate to succeed

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:59.650
Jeor Mormont as the next Lord Commander. The
producers said they’re not going to recast

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:03.870
the role. They had only filmed for 4 days
so he still had scenes left to finish.

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:09.490
They’ll probably just write around it and
speed up the transition to the new Lord Commander.

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:14.730
If you’ve read the books just use spoiler
tags when commenting about it.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:19.200
and last question number 10 - The Jeebz Machine
says, Charlie never replies to me and it makes

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:20.220
